.TH geectl-remote-delete-token 1  "geectl-remote-delete-token 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-delete\-token \- Delete one of the authenticated user\*(Aqs operation\-scoped tokens, by id. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote delete\-token\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete one of the authenticated user\*(Aqs operation\-scoped tokens, by id. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
The id of the token to delete
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
